{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "You're banging him... aren't you? You of all people should know... Idols aren't allowed to do that!": "",
  "You've got it all wrong! I would <font_kind=yakuza_italic>never</font_kind> act that way, and I'm not an idol, either!": "",
  "Then explain to me, your dedicated fan who's been loyal to you this whole time, <font_kind=yakuza_italic>why</font_kind> you were sneaking around together!": "",
  "Sana-chan! Are you all right?": "",
  "So, you finally show your face. Y-You're a bastard, you know that? Tricking Sana-chan just to get in her p-p-pants!": "",
  "That's ridiculous. I've done no such thing.": "",
  "Oh? Well I saw her going in and out of your office... <font_kind=yakuza_italic>multiple</font_kind> times! Wearing the same lewd expression...": "",
  "It was like a dog in heat, enjoying every last hump. That's what he turned you into, Sana-chan... A horny bitch!": "",
  "...Okay, I think I pieced it together now. You must be the one who sent that photo to her manager. Some fan you are.": "",
  "So what if I did!?": "",
  "Sana-chan is the Songstress of Kamurocho... Which means she belongs to everyone! Not some sleazy scumbag like you!": "",
  "Well? Maybe that'll calm you down a bit?": "",
  "You... don't understand me... at all.": "",
  "I did this... for Sana-chan's sake...": "",
  "I-If she's about to make a huge mistake with her life, then it's up to me, her diehard fan, to try and help prevent it!": "",
  "And what mistake would that be? Choosing who she wants to be around, and what she wants to do, for herself?": "",
  "N-No, her <font_kind=yakuza_italic>mistake</font_kind> was betraying her entire fanbase... By hooking up with a manipulative little weasel like you!!": "",
  "Sana-chan... You need to be more aware of your duties as a singer... A-As a cultural icon!": "",
  "...Let me ask you something. What exactly is it that you like about Sana-chan?": "",
  "H-Huh?": "",
  "Is it her music? Her looks? Her personality? ...Do you even know the first thing about her?": "",
  "What are you trying to get at!?": "",
  "A real fan would support the person they believe in, even if they didn't always agree with their decisions. Right?": "",
  "Wh... Wh... What would you know!?": "",
  "Kabata-san. You once wrote me something that I remember to this day.": "",
  "\"I really love your music because it captures raw human emotion and expresses it in an authentic, relatable way.\"": "",
  "You... remember that?": "",
  "Yes, and it made me so happy when I first read it. It still does.": "",
  "I've kept it stored safely ever since, and whenever I'm feeling really down, I take it out and read it over again.": "",
  "Y-You do...?": "",
  "Believe me. I really do appreciate your concern over my well-being.": "",
  "But my inner feelings—that raw human emotion you spoke of—are the driving force of my songs.": "",
  "Even... love? The IRL kind?": "",
  "So, if you really do like my music, please try to understand this other aspect of me.": "",
  "That way I can keep on making music that's true to the heart.": "",
  "And you're a big part of that. You gave me a chance before I was even anybody... That means you're in my heart, too.": "",
  "S-Sana-chan...": "",
  "*sniffle* For... Forgive me...": "",
  "I hope he learned something today.": "",
  "He did. I'm sure of it.": "",
  "I appreciate you spending time with me today.": "",
  "Thanks to you, I feel like a huge weight's been lifted off my shoulders.": "",
  "Glad to hear it, Sana-chan.": "",
  "You know... I just wanted to say thank you... and say I'm sorry. For dragging you into all my problems.": "",
  "No need to apologize. I'm always happy to help.": "",
  "You're a nice guy, Yagami-san... See you around.": "",
  "Then why don't we talk about something else first?": "",
  "You mentioned you had something important to talk to me about?": "",
  "Oh, yes! Regarding that...": "",
  "Ahhh, I can't do it! Sorry! I'm just not ready!": "",
  "(Something's really eating away at her... Maybe we should talk about something else first, to help ease her mind.)": "",
  "How's that manager of yours? I'm glad you worked things out.": "",
  "Yep. Turns out all I needed to do was take some time and sort out how I felt.": "",
  "After talking to him for a little bit and sharing what I was going through, he said he understood.": "",
  "Since he really values the integrity of my music, he said he'd try to negotiate the no-dating policy with the people up top.": "",
  "That's a very considerate boss you've got there.": "",
  "Yep. Gotta work hard for his sake, too.": "",
  "And how's your latest single? What's that all about?": "",
  "I may have said it before, but it's a love song.": "",
  "More specifically, a song about one-sided love.": "",
  "Inspired by true events, maybe?": "",
  "It's a little embarrassing to think this will actually be released to the public. Hehe.": "",
  "You know, the more I\nspend time with you...": "",
  "And... I'd like to be\nyour girlfriend!": "",
  "(I had a feeling she liked me... But to come right out and say it...)": "",
  "So... will you give me your answer?": "",
  "If you really think I'm good enough for you...": "",
  "Then let's look forward to a bright future together.": "",
  "You... really mean that?": "",
  "Of course. I've been wanting this for a long time, too.": "",
  "Oh, thank goodness! Don't go breaking my heart now...": "",
  "(This might work out fine for now, but will it really be okay in the long run...?)": "",
  "I can hardly believe this is happening...": "",
  "Hehe, I know I say this all the time, but it really is like we're living in a dream.": "",
  "It's no dream... I can assure you of that.": "",
  "...Then show me. Help me know our love is real.": "",
  "...Um. Yagami-san. Can I call you Takayuki-san from now on?": "",
  "Of course you can.": "",
  "(It's official. Sana-chan and I are a couple now.)": "",
  "(I'm sure it won't be easy to balance our careers with our love lives... But I'll do whatever it takes to support her.)": "",
  "It pains me to say this, but I'm kind of already in a relationship... with my job.": "",
  "Wh-What do you mean...?": "",
  "Things are really hectic because of this case I'm working on. Lives are on the line, so I can't really think about romance.": "",
  "Yeah... So the thing is, I actually have a girlfriend. Probably should have mentioned that at some point.": "",
  "Oh. I figured as much, a nice guy like you...": "",
  "Sorry. You're a really sweet girl, Sana-chan. I know you'll make someone very happy someday.": "",
  "...It's fine.": "",
  "Sorry I sprang that on you out of nowhere...": "",
  "N-No worries. I'm... sorry too.": "",
  "Well... I guess that's it, then.": "",
  "(Now I feel terrible... but I made the right choice.)": "",
  "So this is what a batting center looks like... Wow, it's not as sketchy as I thought it'd be.": "",
  "Hope I can actually hit the ball...": "",
  "Why don't I show you how it's done?": "",
  "Ooh, go for it!": "",
  "(Now's my chance to impress her. Better not strike out!)": "",
  "Are you gonna hit some home runs for me?": "",
  "Yep. Just watch and learn.": "",
  "Hehe, I'll be taking notes then.": "",
  "(This is it. My big chance to impress Sana-chan. Here I go!)": "",
  "Oh my gosh! I had no idea you were this good! You were like a pro out there.": "",
  "All I did was put in a little effort today. There was really nothing to it.": "",
  "Wow, I didn't know you were so athletic! You were awesome.": "",
  "(Hmm, not bad, I suppose...)": "",
  "You scored... kind of okay, I guess. \"A\" for effort?": "",
  "Yeah, I wasn't really feeling it today...": "",
  "Oh? Are you feeling under the weather, maybe?": "",
  "Not so much, it's just... I'm not always like this.": "",
  "Don't worry, we all have those days.": "",
  "(Crap. That was the complete opposite of cool...)": "",
  "All right, Sana-chan, show me what you've got.": "",
  "Fwa ha ha... To tell the truth, I'm actually really good. Ready to lose?": "",
  "...Oh, I don't think I'll be losing anytime soon.": "",
  "Sounds like you're pretty sure of yourself. Then show me what you got!": "",
  "Okay, but I won't hold anything back.": "",
  "Haha, bring it on!": "",
  "How about a rematch, Sana-chan?": "",
  "I'll take you on anytime! Ready to lose?": "",
  "I don't plan on it.": "",
  "Aww... You totally destroyed me... You're way too strong!": "",
  "Heh. If you want to win against me, you're gonna need a lot more practice.": "",
  "Hmph! You just wait till next time... Victory will be mine!": "",
  "So... it ended in a draw, huh?": "",
  "Yeah! I didn't know you were so good!": "",
  "Same to you. But I'll make sure I win next time.": "",
  "Then I'll make sure to practice! 'Cause I wanna win too.": "",
  "Yay! I won!": "",
  "Dang... I can do better than this...!": "",
  "Don't worry. I'll let you have a rematch any time you want.": "",
  "(...Next time I'll win for sure...)": "",
  "Yagami-san, I really want that plushie. I'm collecting them!": "",
  "Can you get it for me?": "",
  "Leave it to me.": "",
  "Yagami-san, I really want that plushie! I'm collecting them right now!": "",
  "One plushie, coming right up.": "",
  "You did it! Wow, that's so cool... I can't believe you actually got one!": "",
  "Haha, I think I finally got the hang of it.": "",
  "Can I really have this?": "",
  "I sure hope so!": "",
  "Thanks so much! Promise I'll take good care of it!": "",
  "All right! Got that plush you wanted.": "",
  "...Huh? Why this one?": "",
  "Wait, this wasn't the right one?": "",
  "Well, no, but... it's fine. I guess it is kinda cute.": "",
  "(I got the wrong one... But she seems to like it just fine.)": "",
  "Aww! You were so close, too! Better luck next time, huh?": "",
  "(Should I try again?)": "",
  "(Okay, I'll give it one more shot.)": "",
  "I prefer someone my age.": "",
  "And why is that?": "",
  "Well, wouldn't you have more in common with someone your own age? I feel like there'd be more to talk about.": "",
  "Possibly. On the other hand, I'd think that all the little differences could make for some interesting conversation.": "",
  "Absolutely!": "",
  "As long as the couple is mature about it, I'm sure that working around an age gap could actually be a fun thing.": "",
  "Do I detect an ulterior motive here? 'Cause it sounds like you're saying I should go for younger girls.": "",
  "Oh really? And why do you think that might be?": "",
  "Hey, you tell me.": "",
  "No worries. Here, have a seat.": "",
  "Thank you...": "",
  "So, you mentioned you had something important to talk over with me?": "",
  "I'm... sorry, I don't think I can just yet.": "",
  "All right, Yagami-san... I think I'm ready for that big talk now...": "",
  "I'm all ears, Sana-chan.": "",
  "Okay... Deep breaths, girl. Deep breaths...": "",
  "(So, what should we talk about here...)": "",
  "Talk to me, Yagami-san! Hehe.": "",
  "(Talking to a girl at my office about something other than work is kinda nice...)": "",
  "(Now what's something we could talk about...)": "",
  "So, Sana-chan. What made you want to get into music?": "",
  "Well, I've always liked singing to begin with.": "",
  "And whenever I did sing, people would always compliment my voice. So I ended up doing school competitions and all that.": "",
  "Before I knew it, I found myself wanting to become a professional singer. That's pretty much it.": "",
  "Wow, and look at where you are now.": "",
  "Not everyone can do what they want in life.": "",
  "You must have some real talent to have made it this far.": "",
  "Oh yeah. Take your fans, for example. You have this special something that keeps drawing them in.": "",
  "Hehe, well. I hope they'd be drawn in by my music...": "",
  "What about you, Yagami-san? Would you consider yourself a fan?": "",
  "You bet I would.": "",
  "Yay! Then maybe you'll be my number one... someday. ❤": "",
  "You must've been really lucky.": "",
  "Definitely. Otherwise, I doubt all this would've happened so quickly.": "",
  "By the way, this has been on my mind for a while. Yagami-san, why'd you become a detective?": "",
  "Hmm, now there's a question.": "",
  "If I had single out a reason...": "",
  "...It's because we don't need to wear suits.": "",
  "Huh? That's all?": "",
  "Totally. Suits are way too stuffy, and besides, they make my shoulders all stiff.": "",
  "\"Dress casual, work comfortable.\" That's just how I roll.": "",
  "Haha, you're just messing with me, aren't you?": "",
  "...Actually, I was being serious.": "",
  "Really? But you'd look so good in a suit...": "",
  "Then how about I wear one for you next time?": "",
  "You will? Then I'll hold you to it!": "",
  "Actually, I've been wondering something, Sana-chan...": "",
  "Is it really okay for you to be coming over like this?": "",
  "Well, it's just... you know. I wasn't sure if you were dating anyone or not, so...": "",
  "Oh, that's what you meant.": "",
  "In that case, it's totally fine. I'm currently boyfriend-free.": "",
  "Well... that's a relief.": "",
  "It is?": "",
  "Hehe. If that was your natural reaction, then I'm relieved too.": "",
  "Yeah. Looks like I got all worried for nothing.": "",
  "Right! There's nothing to be concerned about. Nothing at all!": "",
  "Besides, what kinda girlfriend would I be if I went to another man's house and started cooking him curry?": "",
  "You make a good point.": "",
  "But now that you brought it up... You're not taken either, are you?": "",
  "(She's asking if I have a girlfriend...)": "",
  "Nope, still single. Unfortunately. ": "",
  "No way! A good-looking guy like you?": "",
  "I know I shouldn't be happy, but... ♪": "",
  "Besides, I'm not the kind of guy who invites a girl over and has them make curry when I already have a girlfriend.": "",
  "Ahaha. I would hope not.": "",
  "(I said I wasn't taken, but... This is gonna net me some bad karma, isn't it...)": "",
  "Actually, I am taken.": "",
  "...Does it surprise you that much?": "",
  "No, I wouldn't say surprised. It's just that... since the two of us are hanging out at your place... <font_kind=yakuza_italic>alone</font_kind>...": "",
  "I thought you might be single.": "",
  "Oh. I see.": "",
  "Uh-huh. Yeah.": "",
  "Huh? What's wrong?": "",
  "Nothing... I'm just a little shocked!": "",
  "Ooh...": "",
  "Yeah, I've been working on some lyrics for a song that's been in my head.": "",
  "Wow. What kind of song is it?": "",
  "...You really want to know?": "",
  "Of course. I am your number one fan, after all.": "",
  "Ehehe. I'm a little embarrassed to say... But it's a love song.": "",
  "Oh? What kind of love song?": "",
  "It's about coming to terms with your feelings... Like when your heart tells you one thing, but your mind says another.": "",
  "That's what I've got so far.": "",
  "So it's about someone with a wavering heart?": "",
  "Are you basing it off actual experience?": "",
  "Yes. What I realized when writing this song... is that I'm head-over-heels in love.": "",
  "Huh? You are? With who?": "",
  "...That's for me to know and for you to find out.": "",
  "Agh, the suspense is killing me...": "",
  "(Should I invite Sana-chan out? ...No, now's probably not a good time.)": "",
  "(Okay, time to ask her out.)": "",
  "Yeah! Wanna go somewhere?": "",
  "Let's meet up at Theater Square and figure it out from there.": "",
  "No worries, I just got here too.": "",
  "(Should I give her a present right now?)": "",
  "So, I actually have something for you...": "",
  "Yeah. Check this out...": "",
  "Wow, that's such a cute ring! Aww, and it's shaped just like a heart!": "",
  "(Whew. Glad she likes it.)": "",
  "That's really sweet of you...": "",
  "Can I put it on?": "",
  "There. Hehe, so what do you think?": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "H-Huh?": "ห-หา?",
  "Of course you can.": "ได้สิ",
  "Leave it to me.": "ปล่อยให้ฉันจัดการเถอะ",
  "Absolutely!": "แน่นอนอยู่แล้ว!",
  "Thank you...": "ขอบคุณนะ...",
  "Huh? That's all?": "หา? มีแค่นั้นเองเหรอ?",
  "It is?": "งั้นเหรอ?",
  "You make a good point.": "พูดมีเหตุผลดีนะ",
  "Oh. I see.": "อ้อ เข้าใจแล้ว",
  "Huh? What's wrong?": "หา? มีอะไรเหรอ?",
